WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.077
Now compare that with wide form.

00:00:02.077 --> 00:00:10.362
Instead of storing January and February as row values, we create separate January and February columns.

00:00:10.362 --> 00:00:12.497
The grain has changed.

00:00:12.497 --> 00:00:19.782
One row now represents one product, while the month information is spread horizontally across columns.

00:00:19.782 --> 00:00:26.822
Wide form can be very convenient for scorecards and reports where people want to compare a small number of fixed

00:00:26.822 --> 00:00:28.585
categories side by side.
